  "<h2>EMBED</h2><p>OBS 브라우저 소스나 홈페이지 iframe에 마을만 띄우는 링크예요. 링크만 있으면 누구나 볼 수 있으니(방문자 정보 패널·설정은 없어요) 공개해도 괜찮은 곳에만 넣어 주세요.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><label class=\"toggle\">테마 <select id=\"emTheme\">{0}</select></label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"emLabels\" checked>건물 이름</label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"emNight\" checked>낮·밤</label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"emBadges\" checked>인원 배지</label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"emMarks\" checked>방문자 표시</label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"emHeat\">발자국</label></div>\n      <div id=\"emBody\"></div><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"emMake\"></button><button class=\"btn\" id=\"emClose\">닫기</button><span class=\"muted\" id=\"emMsg\"></span></div>": "<h2>EMBED</h2><p>A link that shows just the town, for an OBS browser source or an iframe on your homepage. Anyone with the link can watch (no visitor info panel or settings), so only put it where it's OK to be public.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><label class=\"toggle\">Theme <select id=\"emTheme\">{0}</select></label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"emLabels\" checked>Building names</label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"emNight\" checked>Day · night</label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"emBadges\" checked>Head counts</label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"emMarks\" checked>Visitor marks</label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"emHeat\">Footprints</label></div>\n      <div id=\"emBody\"></div><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"emMake\"></button><button class=\"btn\" id=\"emClose\">Close</button><span class=\"muted\" id=\"emMsg\"></span></div>",
  " (잠김)": " (locked)",
