  "<h2>WEBHOOK</h2><p class=\"err\">{0}</p><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"whClose\">닫기</button></div>": "<h2>WEBHOOK</h2><p class=\"err\">{0}</p><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"whClose\">Close</button></div>",
  "<h2>WEBHOOK</h2><p class=\"muted\">슬랙 Incoming Webhook이나 디스코드 채널 웹훅 주소를 넣으면 대시보드 탭이 닫혀 있어도 알림을 받아요. 주소는 주인·편집 멤버만 볼 수 있어요.</p>\n      <form id=\"whForm\"><label>웹훅 주소 <input id=\"whUrl\" type=\"url\" placeholder=\"https://hooks.slack.com/services/… 또는 https://discord.com/api/webhooks/…\" value=\"{0}\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label>\n      <div class=\"wh-opts\"><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whEvents\"{1}>알림을 켠 이벤트 <span class=\"muted\">(이벤트 설정의 '알림', 기본은 구매)</span></label>\n      <label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whOnline\"{2}>접속자 <input id=\"whOnlineN\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"9999\" value=\"{3}\" style=\"width:64px\"> 명에 닿으면 <span class=\"muted\">(10분에 한 번)</span></label>\n      <label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whQuiet\"{4}>30분 넘게 이벤트가 없으면 <span class=\"muted\">(스크립트 빠짐)</span></label>\n      <label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whAnomaly\"{5}>평소와 다를 때 <span class=\"muted\">(지난 6일 같은 시간 평균 대비 3배 이상 급증·1/4 이하 급감, 15분마다 확인)</span></label>\n      <label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whDaily\"{6}>아침 9시 어제 요약 <span class=\"muted\">(방문·조회·많이 본 페이지·유입·매출)</span></label>\n      <label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whMilestone\"{7}>기록 갱신 <span class=\"muted\">(1,000번째 방문자, 동시 접속 최고, 첫 해외 방문자, 나라 수)</span></label></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"submit\">저장</button><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"whTest\"{8}>테스트 보내기</button><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"whClose\">닫기</button><span class=\"muted\" id=\"whMsg\"></span></div></form>": "<h2>WEBHOOK</h2><p class=\"muted\">Add a Slack Incoming Webhook or Discord channel webhook URL to get alerts even when the dashboard tab is closed. Only the owner and editors can see the URL.</p>\n      <form id=\"whForm\"><label>Webhook URL <input id=\"whUrl\" type=\"url\" placeholder=\"https://hooks.slack.com/services/… or https://discord.com/api/webhooks/…\" value=\"{0}\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label>\n      <div class=\"wh-opts\"><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whEvents\"{1}>Events with alerts on <span class=\"muted\">('Alert' in event settings, purchases by default)</span></label>\n      <label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whOnline\"{2}>When online visitors reach <input id=\"whOnlineN\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"9999\" value=\"{3}\" style=\"width:64px\"> <span class=\"muted\">(once per 10 min)</span></label>\n      <label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whQuiet\"{4}>No events for 30+ min <span class=\"muted\">(script missing)</span></label>\n      <label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whAnomaly\"{5}>Unusual traffic <span class=\"muted\">(3× spike or drop to ¼ or less vs. the same hour over the last 6 days, checked every 15 min)</span></label>\n      <label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whDaily\"{6}>Yesterday's summary at 9 AM <span class=\"muted\">(visits, views, top pages, sources, revenue)</span></label>\n      <label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"whMilestone\"{7}>New records <span class=\"muted\">(1,000th visitor, peak concurrent, first foreign visitor, country count)</span></label></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"submit\">Save</button><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"whTest\"{8}>Send test</button><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"whClose\">Close</button><span class=\"muted\" id=\"whMsg\"></span></div></form>",
