  "<h2>NOTE</h2><p class=\"muted\">배포·광고 시작·장애 복구처럼 \"그때 무슨 일이 있었는지\"를 적어 두면 리플레이 시간축에 눈금으로 남아 전후를 비교할 수 있어요. 메모는 사이트 기록에 저장되고 다른 멤버에게도 보여요.</p>\n      <form id=\"ntForm\"><label>내용 <input id=\"ntText\" required maxlength=\"80\" placeholder=\"예: v2.3 배포\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label><label>시각 <select id=\"ntAgo\"><option value=\"0\">지금</option><option value=\"5\">5분 전</option><option value=\"15\">15분 전</option><option value=\"30\">30분 전</option><option value=\"60\">1시간 전</option><option value=\"180\">3시간 전</option></select></label>\n      <div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"submit\">남기기</button><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"ntClose\">닫기</button><span class=\"muted\" id=\"ntMsg\"></span></div></form>": "<h2>NOTE</h2><p class=\"muted\">Jot down \"what happened then\", like a deploy, ad launch or outage fix, and it stays as a tick on the replay timeline so you can compare before and after. Notes are saved to the site history and visible to other members.</p>\n      <form id=\"ntForm\"><label>Note <input id=\"ntText\" required maxlength=\"80\" placeholder=\"e.g. v2.3 deployed\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label><label>When <select id=\"ntAgo\"><option value=\"0\">Now</option><option value=\"5\">5 min ago</option><option value=\"15\">15 min ago</option><option value=\"30\">30 min ago</option><option value=\"60\">1 hour ago</option><option value=\"180\">3 hours ago</option></select></label>\n      <div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"submit\">Add note</button><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"ntClose\">Close</button><span class=\"muted\" id=\"ntMsg\"></span></div></form>",
