  "<h2>BUILDINGS</h2><p class=\"muted\">{0}</p>\n      <div class=\"tabs\"><button class=\"btn tab\" data-tab=\"b\" aria-pressed=\"true\">건물</button><button class=\"btn tab\" data-tab=\"p\" aria-pressed=\"false\">경로</button></div>\n      <div id=\"bsTabB\"><p class=\"muted\">건물은 광장 포함 {1}개까지. 자리·종류를 바꾸면 뒤 지도에 바로 보여요(저장 전엔 임시). 이름을 비우면 테마 기본 이름이에요.</p>\n        <div class=\"bt\" id=\"bsTable\"></div><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"bsAdd\">+ 건물 추가</button><span class=\"muted\" id=\"bsCount\"></span><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"bsAdv\">고급: 경로 패턴(정규식) 직접 편집</label></div></div>\n      <div id=\"bsTabP\" hidden><p class=\"muted\" id=\"bsSeenHint\"></p>\n        <div class=\"row\"><input id=\"bsTry\" placeholder=\"/deals/123 처럼 주소를 넣어 보세요\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocomplete=\"off\"><span id=\"bsTryOut\" class=\"muted\"></span><button class=\"btn\" id=\"bsTryAdd\" hidden>목록에 추가</button></div>\n        <div class=\"paths\" id=\"bsPaths\"></div></div>\n      <p class=\"err\" id=\"bsWarn\" hidden></p><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"bsSave\">저장</button><button class=\"btn\" id=\"bsClose\">닫기</button><span class=\"muted\" id=\"bsMsg\"></span></div>": "<h2>BUILDINGS</h2><p class=\"muted\">{0}</p>\n      <div class=\"tabs\"><button class=\"btn tab\" data-tab=\"b\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Buildings</button><button class=\"btn tab\" data-tab=\"p\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Paths</button></div>\n      <div id=\"bsTabB\"><p class=\"muted\">Up to {1} buildings, plaza included. Changing a slot or type shows on the map right away (temporary until saved). Leave the name blank to use the theme's default.</p>\n        <div class=\"bt\" id=\"bsTable\"></div><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"bsAdd\">+ Add building</button><span class=\"muted\" id=\"bsCount\"></span><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"bsAdv\">Advanced: edit path patterns (regex)</label></div></div>\n      <div id=\"bsTabP\" hidden><p class=\"muted\" id=\"bsSeenHint\"></p>\n        <div class=\"row\"><input id=\"bsTry\" placeholder=\"Try a path like /deals/123\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocomplete=\"off\"><span id=\"bsTryOut\" class=\"muted\"></span><button class=\"btn\" id=\"bsTryAdd\" hidden>Add to list</button></div>\n        <div class=\"paths\" id=\"bsPaths\"></div></div>\n      <p class=\"err\" id=\"bsWarn\" hidden></p><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"bsSave\">Save</button><button class=\"btn\" id=\"bsClose\">Close</button><span class=\"muted\" id=\"bsMsg\"></span></div>",
