  "알 수 없음": "Unknown",
  "아직 코호트가 없어요. 일별 집계(site_daily)에 첫 방문 날짜가 쌓이기 시작한 뒤(SDK 2026-11-04 이후분)부터 보여요. DB 없는 로컬 서버는 비어 있어요.": "No cohorts yet. They appear once first-visit dates start building up in the daily stats (site_daily; SDK data from 2026-11-04 on). A local server without a DB stays empty.",
  "데이터가 없어요.": "No data.",
  "<p class=\"st-sub\">첫 방문 주(월요일 시작)별 세션 코호트 · 최근 {0}주 · D1 = 다음 날 다시 온 비율, D7 = 7일 뒤. 방문자 ID 없이 첫 방문 날짜만 세므로 세션 단위 근사치예요.</p>\n    <div class=\"st-tiles\"><div class=\"st-tile\">신규 세션<b>{1}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">D1 평균<b>{2}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">D7 평균<b>{3}</b></div></div>\n    <div class=\"st-block\"><h3>COHORT</h3><table class=\"rt\"><thead><tr><th>첫 방문 주</th><th>신규</th><th>D1</th><th>D7</th></tr></thead><tbody>{4}</tbody></table></div>": "<p class=\"st-sub\">Session cohorts by first-visit week (starting Monday) · last {0} {0:week|weeks} · D1 = share who came back the next day, D7 = 7 days later. Counts first-visit dates only, without visitor IDs, so it's a session-level estimate.</p>\n    <div class=\"st-tiles\"><div class=\"st-tile\">New sessions<b>{1}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">D1 avg<b>{2}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">D7 avg<b>{3}</b></div></div>\n    <div class=\"st-block\"><h3>COHORT</h3><table class=\"rt\"><thead><tr><th>First week</th><th>New</th><th>D1</th><th>D7</th></tr></thead><tbody>{4}</tbody></table></div>",
  "<div class=\"st-tiles\"><div class=\"st-tile\">접속자<b data-k=\"n\">0</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">재방문<b data-k=\"ret\">-</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">평균 체류<b data-k=\"dwell\">-</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">봇<b data-k=\"bots\">0</b></div></div>\n    <div class=\"st-cols\"><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>BUILDING</h3><div data-b=\"page\"></div></div><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>DEVICE</h3><div data-b=\"device\"></div></div><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>REFERRER</h3><div data-b=\"referrer\"></div></div><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>COUNTRY <span class=\"st-sub\">(추정)</span></h3><div data-b=\"country\"></div></div><div class=\"st-block\" data-blk=\"campaign\" hidden><h3>CAMPAIGN <span class=\"st-sub\">(UTM)</span></h3><div data-b=\"campaign\"></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"st-block\"><h3>NOW <span data-k=\"n2\">0</span></h3><div class=\"st-list\" id=\"stNowList\"><p class=\"st-sub\" id=\"stNowEmpty\">지금은 아무도 없어요</p></div></div>": "<div class=\"st-tiles\"><div class=\"st-tile\">Online<b data-k=\"n\">0</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">Returning<b data-k=\"ret\">-</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">Avg stay<b data-k=\"dwell\">-</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">Bots<b data-k=\"bots\">0</b></div></div>\n    <div class=\"st-cols\"><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>BUILDING</h3><div data-b=\"page\"></div></div><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>DEVICE</h3><div data-b=\"device\"></div></div><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>REFERRER</h3><div data-b=\"referrer\"></div></div><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>COUNTRY <span class=\"st-sub\">(est.)</span></h3><div data-b=\"country\"></div></div><div class=\"st-block\" data-blk=\"campaign\" hidden><h3>CAMPAIGN <span class=\"st-sub\">(UTM)</span></h3><div data-b=\"campaign\"></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"st-block\"><h3>NOW <span data-k=\"n2\">0</span></h3><div class=\"st-list\" id=\"stNowList\"><p class=\"st-sub\" id=\"stNowEmpty\">No one here right now</p></div></div>",
