  "<p class=\"st-sub\">오늘 00:00부터 지금까지 · 이벤트 {0}건{1}</p>\n    <div class=\"st-tiles\"><div class=\"st-tile\">방문<b>{2}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">페이지뷰<b>{3}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">평균 체류<b>{4}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">재방문<b>{5}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">봇<b>{6}</b></div>{7}</div>\n    <div class=\"st-block\"><h3>BY HOUR</h3><div class=\"hist\">{8}</div><div class=\"hist-x\"><span>0시</span><span>6시</span><span>12시</span><span>18시</span><span>23시</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"st-cols\"><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>BUILDING</h3>{9}</div>{10}<div class=\"st-block\"><h3>DEVICE</h3>{11}</div><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>REFERRER</h3>{12}</div><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>COUNTRY <span class=\"st-sub\">(추정)</span></h3>{13}</div></div>": "<p class=\"st-sub\">Today from 00:00 to now · {0} {0:event|events}{1}</p>\n    <div class=\"st-tiles\"><div class=\"st-tile\">Visits<b>{2}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">Pageviews<b>{3}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">Avg stay<b>{4}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">Returning<b>{5}</b></div><div class=\"st-tile\">Bots<b>{6}</b></div>{7}</div>\n    <div class=\"st-block\"><h3>BY HOUR</h3><div class=\"hist\">{8}</div><div class=\"hist-x\"><span>0h</span><span>6h</span><span>12h</span><span>18h</span><span>23h</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"st-cols\"><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>BUILDING</h3>{9}</div>{10}<div class=\"st-block\"><h3>DEVICE</h3>{11}</div><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>REFERRER</h3>{12}</div><div class=\"st-block\"><h3>COUNTRY <span class=\"st-sub\">(est.)</span></h3>{13}</div></div>",
